{"id":120927681876637,"name":"[UPD] Soulrift","desc":"Step into a realm between heaven and hell.. A purgatory where only the most godlike beings are bound. This is a round-based boss fighting game where every encounter tests nothing but your skill. \n\nFight a variety of bosses, each with their own unique attack patterns, mechanics, and fight-defining gimmicks.\n\nUnlock and play as a diverse roster of characters, each with their own abilities, specialties, and playstyles.\n\nContain them all. Your job starts now.\n\nCONTROLS (Keybinds are changeable in settings)\n- Left Click: M1\n- Q: Dash\n- Z: Ability 1\n- X: Ability 2\n- C: Ability 3","path":"/game/120927681876637-soulrift","slug":"120927681876637-soulrift","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/67e9bc9df89ead64bbdce447dc578c10aa09f73fc2b2456633b141c814f06162.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-efe20367e514816318ad2ca067fcd7b7/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":15,"visitor":1184938,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-26T16:05:23.568Z","creator":{"name":"Akhi's Projects","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"UPD-Soulrift-Be-unkillable-(use-during-a-boss-cutscene)-225605","_id":"6a8f0ec3807c516f5d90cab7","title":"Be unkillable (use during a boss cutscene)","game":{"_id":"6a8f0ec3807c516f5d90cab6","gameId":120927681876637,"name":"[UPD] Soulrift","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":120927681876637},"features":"Gives u a lot of hp so u don't die\nNote: u must use this script during a boss cutscene","tags":[],"script":"local args = {\n    [1] = {\n        [\"Event\"] = \"CharacterSpawn\",\n        [\"Health\"] = 1000000000000\n    }\n}\n\ngame:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\").Remotes.HealthRemotes.HealthChanged:FireServer(unpack(args))\n","owner":{"_id":"68975130ab0